one world and our point of view splits with everything into increasingly more
numerous increasingly isolated parts of it.  If the neighboring worlds didn't
interact (i.e., if they weren't all part of the same reality) there wouldn't
be QM phenomena for MW to explain.

Anyway I don't see how PCR standards have anything to say about this directly.

